<%= ui_callout_box :warning,
                title: "Burn Weekend — Your Help Is Needed",
                icon: "fire", accent: true do %>
  <dl class="instruction-list">
    <dt>The Ask</dt>
    <dd>
      Sign up for at least <b>one shift</b> on Burn Weekend
      (Friday night – Sunday night), ideally including a
      <b>Burn Perimeter</b> shift.
    </dd>

    <dt>Why?</dt>
    <dd>It's our busiest time — solid staffing is critical.</dd>

    <dt>This message</dt>
    <dd>Goes away once you sign up for a weekend shift.</dd>
  </dl>
<% end %>
